Vice-Chair, as appropriate;
• Prepare the agenda, table of conclusions and minutes of the meetings of the MLWP in
consultation with the Chair or Vice-Chair, as appropriate;
• Communicate when necessary any HMPC recommendations relevant to the MLWP to interested
parties;
• Contribute to the identification of experts.
2. The Executive Director of the Agency, members of the EMA Secretariat, and representatives of the
European Commission, may attend all meetings of the MLWP.

